    "description": "<p>When a <strong>potion</strong> or <strong>delicacy</strong> you created that <strong>does not</strong> deal damage causes one or more creatures to recover Hit Points, you may instead have it deal <strong>poison</strong> damage equal to <strong>【half your level + (SL × 10)】</strong> to each of those creatures. This damage type cannot change, and it is <strong>halved</strong> if you are dealing damage to <strong>two or more creatures</strong>.</p><hr><p><strong>Target Suffers:</strong> @DMG[($cl/2)+($sl*10) poison]{Level/2 + (SL × 10) Poison (Single)} or @DMG[(($cl/2)+($sl*10)/2) poison]{Level/2 + (SL × 10) /2 Poison (Multi)}</p>",
